omaxian-calamares-settings (0.2.7) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Formats follow the installer language unless changed on the Locale page:
    Calamares guessed LC_* from the time zone's country (English (US) +
    Europe/Rome showed and installed "italiano" numbers/dates). The live
    /usr/share/i18n/SUPPORTED (diverted) also lists bare language tags, which
    Calamares prefers for its automatic formats; the new omaxianlocale job
    (before localecfg) maps them to LANG. Explicit choices are kept.
    calamares-locale-formats no longer guesses from the time zone.

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 22:30:00 +0100

omaxian-calamares-settings (0.2.6) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Live session: polkit rule so the live user starts the installer without a
    password prompt (live-config's .pkla grant is ignored by polkitd >= 121).
    Only "pkexec env DISPLAY=.. XAUTHORITY=.. calamares", sudo group, boot=live;
    calamares-post removes it on the installed system.

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 21:12:00 +0100

omaxian-calamares-settings (0.2.5) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Live session: "Install Omaxian OS" is the first hit for "install" in the
    launcher (stock "Install System" hidden), Super+Shift+I, a ~/Desktop shortcut
    and a one-time welcome notification with an Install action
    (/etc/X11/Xsession.d/38omaxian-live-installer, boot=live only; purged with
    this package on the installed system).

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 20:34:35 +0100

omaxian-calamares-settings (0.2.4) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * calamares-locale-formats (run from calamares-post): formats (LC_*) follow
    the language chosen in the installer. Calamares derived them from the
    time zone's country, so English (US) + Europe/Rome installed it_IT
    formats (Italian greeter date). Explicit formats from another country
    are kept. Covered by tests/test-locale-formats.sh.

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 20:00:56 +0100

omaxian-calamares-settings (0.2.3) excalibur; urgency=medium

  * Run the EFI fallback fixup from the live host on ${ROOT}: the package is
    purged from the target before the bootloader job, so the chrooted call
    silently did nothing and fresh-NVRAM UEFI boots stopped at grub>.

 -- Omaxian OS <dev@omaxian.org>  Sun, 25 Oct 2026 13:40:10 +0100

